## To release a new version, edit the two lines below and nothing else.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: PB's MiniMap 1.2.2
## Author: PinkBanther
## Description: A lightweight minimap for console. Keeps the game's own world map parked on the HUD at a size and position you choose, and hands it straight back when you open the full map. Based on Votan's Minimap by votan, with thanks -- rebuilt so it stays inside the console add-on memory limit.
## Version: 1.2.2
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106 LibAsync>=30001
## OptionalDependsOn: LibGPS>=73 TweakIt TrueExploration LibDebugLogger
## SavedVariables: PBsMiniMap_Data

## Credit: Based on "Votan's Minimap" by votan (https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1399-VotansMinimap.html).
## Original concept and much of the map handling come from that add-on; this version is reworked for console.

